{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>I Am Jesus Christ</strong> is a first-person narrative experience inspired by the Gospels, letting you witness the life, ministry, and trials of Jesus from a new interactive perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Relive Defining Moments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience key events from the life of Jesus and witness moments whose meaning still resonates today.\u00a0 See these scenes unfold from a personal perspective and engage with the story in a way that feels immediate and immersive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/168ede8142df254fd2d12770e5c6ff45.poster.avif?t=1775229225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/168ede8142df254fd2d12770e5c6ff45.webm?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/168ede8142df254fd2d12770e5c6ff45.mp4?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Journey Through the Holy Land</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel across diverse locations from Jesus\u2019 ministry, from deserts and mountains to towns brought to life with atmosphere and detail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/dc58798759fcfa28b3988c3d7f845494.poster.avif?t=1775229225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/dc58798759fcfa28b3988c3d7f845494.webm?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/dc58798759fcfa28b3988c3d7f845494.mp4?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover the Teachings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the foundations of the Christian faith through an interactive journey inspired by the life and message of Jesus. Gain a deeper sense of the ideas, values, and events that continue to shape millions of lives around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/48e8c217598bf2e3de2a7f0a21a00771.poster.avif?t=1775229225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/48e8c217598bf2e3de2a7f0a21a00771.webm?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/48e8c217598bf2e3de2a7f0a21a00771.mp4?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Resist the Tempter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stand firm against Satan\u2019s temptations and face the spiritual trials that lead to the fulfillment of Scripture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/71900ffff9fafcd42a77e42fcaeecda2.poster.avif?t=1775229225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/71900ffff9fafcd42a77e42fcaeecda2.webm?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/71900ffff9fafcd42a77e42fcaeecda2.mp4?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Read the Scriptures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encounter selected Bible passages throughout the game and connect each moment of the journey to the words that shaped it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/7f8ef72d855e32ede9aeb78b6a0348f1.poster.avif?t=1775229225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/7f8ef72d855e32ede9aeb78b6a0348f1.webm?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/7f8ef72d855e32ede9aeb78b6a0348f1.mp4?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to resist temptation in the desert, heal the sick, and uplift those in need? Perform over 30 meaningful miracles - from feeding the 5,000 and healing lepers to calming the storm and restoring sight to the blind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Key Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the life of Jesus Christ from His baptism to the crucifixion and resurrection</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit faithfully recreated locations in the Holy Land, including Jerusalem and Galilee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform over 30 iconic miracles, such as feeding the 5,000 and walking on water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be guided by the Holy Spirit and strengthen your spiritual connection through prayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet story-driven characters, including Christ's disciples, and reenact key moments such as the Last Supper</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"708c5eed3a4ad7727d58c360cdc71ee7fb9d10bd.jpg","localized_name":"My Beloved Son","name":"My Beloved Son","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1198970/708c5eed3a4ad7727d58c360cdc71ee7fb9d10bd.jpg"},{"icon":"d801cfacfc4849d75bec5a283b6082bb0d30b6d9.jpg","localized_name":"The Scriptures Fulfilled","name":"The Scriptures Fulfilled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1198970/d801cfacfc4849d75bec5a283b6082bb0d30b6d9.jpg"},{"icon":"d543f15bb6b1d4456283118149b57496f891dcdb.jpg","localized_name":"Worship the Lord Your God","name":"Worship the Lord Your God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1198970/d543f15bb6b1d4456283118149b57496f891dcdb.jpg"},{"icon":"b3327b0cb536951ffae438117bf5cad0abbffffb.jpg","localized_name":"Fisher of Men","name":"Fisher of Men","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1198970/b3327b0cb536951ffae438117bf5cad0abbffffb.jpg"},{"icon":"e7c04c3e8208c1b4182d94ebddfd5f7ba0f1c710.jpg","localized_name":"The Holy City","name":"The Holy City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1198970/e7c04c3e8208c1b4182d94ebddfd5f7ba0f1c710.jpg"},{"icon":"249952623d3bbe082ca58fad62297b27943d6f57.jpg","localized_name":"Truly you are the Son of God","name":"Truly you are the Son of God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1198970/249952623d3bbe082ca58fad62297b27943d6f57.jpg"},{"icon":"e1cfe17c13d4e759025aa4ce8a9c754dae35f741.jpg","localized_name":"The Decalogue","name":"The Decalogue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1198970/e1cfe17c13d4e759025aa4ce8a9c75