ls, letting you witness the life, ministry, and trials of Jesus from a new interactive perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Relive Defining Moments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience key events from the life of Jesus and witness moments whose meaning still resonates today.\u00a0 See these scenes unfold from a personal perspective and engage with the story in a way that feels immediate and immersive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/168ede8142df254fd2d12770e5c6ff45.poster.avif?t=1775229225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/168ede8142df254fd2d12770e5c6ff45.webm?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/168ede8142df254fd2d12770e5c6ff45.mp4?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Journey Through the Holy Land</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel across diverse locations from Jesus\u2019 ministry, from deserts and mountains to towns brought to life with atmosphere and detail. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/dc58798759fcfa28b3988c3d7f845494.poster.avif?t=1775229225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/dc58798759fcfa28b3988c3d7f845494.webm?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/dc58798759fcfa28b3988c3d7f845494.mp4?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover the Teachings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the foundations of the Christian faith through an interactive journey inspired by the life and message of Jesus. Gain a deeper sense of the ideas, values, and events that continue to shape millions of lives around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/48e8c217598bf2e3de2a7f0a21a00771.poster.avif?t=1775229225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/48e8c217598bf2e3de2a7f0a21a00771.webm?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/48e8c217598bf2e3de2a7f0a21a00771.mp4?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Resist the Tempter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stand firm against Satan\u2019s temptations and face the spiritual trials that lead to the fulfillment of Scripture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/71900ffff9fafcd42a77e42fcaeecda2.poster.avif?t=1775229225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/71900ffff9fafcd42a77e42fcaeecda2.webm?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198970/extras/71900ffff9fafcd42a77e42fcaeecda2.mp4?t=1775229225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-alig